   syntax: #speedwalk

   Toggles speedwalking.  While you have speedwalking on, you can
   travel n,e,s,w,u and down.

   ex: 3ess2en3es2ws;gate          <-- moves from the vortex to the
                                       Chinchilla farm on 3K and then
                                       opens the gate.

   It doesn't handle diagonals.  I tend to do diagonals like this:

   ex: 3esw;ne;4ne4se4ne4se

   Also note, that 'ne' will go northeast, while 'en' will speedwalk east
   then north.  That's assuming you have 'ne' aliased to northeast.
